# Walk until stone is within mining reach. It is a skill of its own so that a
# failed search is ONE failure of the caller's rule: three failed explores
# inside this frame (the per-rule cap) fail it with not_found, and the caller
# then falls through to its next rule, see get_cobblestone.
skill find_stone()
  doc "Explore until stone is within mining reach; fails not_found when exploring runs out."
  rules:
    near(stone, 5) -> done
    true -> explore(stone)
